    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I think an ECG makes sense here, for palpitations. We'll begin with bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day, until review. It's for heart rate control. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Cut right back on coffee, tea and energy drinks for now. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Come back in three weeks.",
